"87981","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[1]}],"link":"48516","synopsis":"Tomoharu Natsume survived a horrible plane crash but Misao, his close friend, did not and became a ghost that continued to be attached to him. Three years later, he moved out to a place rented by his brother to live on his own and attend Raku High since his mother remarried. On his first day in his new house, a mysterious girl called Shuri turns up and gives him a silver briefcase to look after on behalf of his brother who lives abroad. Soon after, Tomoharu and his best friend, a ghost named Misao Minakami, are attacked by various factions who all seek the 'Asura Machina' and 'Extractor'.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/njKeIEglRM4axRO8elbWNbKxpL.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 1","synopsis":"Tomoharu Natsume survived a horrible plane crash but Misao, his close friend, did not and became a ghost that continued to be attached to him. Three years later, he moved out to a place rented by his brother to live on his own and attend Raku High since his mother remarried. On his first day in his new house, a mysterious girl called Shuri turns up and gives him a silver briefcase to look after on behalf of his brother who lives abroad. Soon after, Tomoharu and his best friend, a ghost named Misao Minakami, are attacked by various factions who all seek the 'Asura Machina' and 'Extractor'.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/njKeIEglRM4axRO8elbWNbKxpL.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6374","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5342","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5342","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42425","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"87981","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2