rns out that Ania's sister, Kristina maybe involved with the demon hunts.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xKbtYdZUxAhFaIls1E9SdydAw4z.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6374","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5342","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5342","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42425","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"87981","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"48524","synopsis":"When an Asura Crying appears during Reishirou's attempt to stop the culprit behind the demon hunts he explains how Tomo is also in danger of becoming one and orders him to leave the matter alone. However, with Ania desperate to find out what has happened to her sister and Tomo sworn to protect her it isn't long before he is face to face with the Asura Crying.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/h2GMZ8xUW2KwQpMPItT4nFp4Mlm.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"When an Asura Crying appears during Reishirou's attempt to stop the culprit behind the demon hunts he explains how Tomo is also in danger of becoming one and orders him to leave the matter alone. However, with Ania desperate to find out what has happened to her sister and Tomo sworn to protect her it isn't long before he is face to face with the Asura Crying.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/h2GMZ8xUW2KwQpMPItT4nFp4Mlm.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6374","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5342","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5342","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42425